NanoGPT
Standard auto-routed text model API usage is billed at list prices with no markup (manually pinned providers add the applicable provider-selection markup, normally 5% with route-specific exceptions; BYOK requests are instead billed at 5% of the normal model cost, since you pay your own provider directly). No percentage deposit fees. Exact cost is returned on chat completion and Responses API responses.
Website: https://nano-gpt.com/
Pricing: https://nano-gpt.com/pricing
Full agent reference: https://nano-gpt.com/llms-full.txt
Advisor API: https://docs.nano-gpt.com/api-reference/miscellaneous/advisor
OpenAI Models API: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/models
Public Models Snapshot: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/models
Embeddings Models API: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/embedding-models
Decision Models API: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/decision-models
Image Models API: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/image-models
Video Models API: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/video-models
Audio Models API: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/audio-models
Inline Batch List: https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/beta/batches
All Batches List (OpenAI-compatible): https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/batches
Anthropic Message Batches: POST/GET https://api.nano-gpt.com/v1/messages/batches (direct Anthropic batch pricing; official Anthropic SDK with base URL https://api.nano-gpt.com and a NanoGPT API key; details in llms-full.txt).
OpenAPI: https://nano-gpt.com/openapi.json
Private API feedback: POST https://api.nano-gpt.com/api/v1/feedback (API key and Idempotency-Key required; the key's account or paying team needs a balance or an active subscription; schema in OpenAPI). Status: GET /api/v1/feedback/{id} using the same key. Submit reports when the user asks or when a reproducible NanoGPT problem blocks the task; never for transient errors, rate limits or low balance. MCP: nanogpt_send_feedback / nanogpt_get_feedback in @nanogpt/mcp 1.6.0+. Never include credentials or automatically upload prompts or responses.
Feedback error codes and retry guidance: https://docs.nano-gpt.com/api-reference/endpoint/feedback (use the receipt ID, not the website ticket ID; 410 is permanent, 503 is temporary).
